    "body": "1)\nTrackers can automatically be removed by the tracker list inside the file remove_trackers.txt\n\n2)\nThese trackers list inside the remove_torrent.txt overrule everything. The trackers inside this file should NEVER be inserted into the torrent files.\n\n3)(todo)\nThe two trackers are inside remove_trackers.txt are just an example. \nI will change the default example tracker to:\nudp://tracker.trackerhoneypot.com:80\n\n4)\nThe main purpose of the file remove_torrent.txt is to remove these trackers without ANY exception. User can put here trackers that they do not trust. User can delete this remove_trackers.txt file. And no trackers will be forbidden.\n",
